;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 120pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.5pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Total cash and cash held in escrow shown on the&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 127.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;statements of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;cash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;flows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 105.56pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 13.2pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;10,154,405&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 6.6pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 18.75pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;9,781,745&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 4.6pt 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Amounts included in cash held in escrow represent cash held in a separate account under the terms of a loan agreement with a lender. This lender restriction will lapse when the related long-term debt is paid off.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 4.6pt 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold"&gt;Income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold"&gt;Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company is a single-member limited liability company. Therefore, the Company is not liable for federal and state income taxes. All items of income and expense are reflected on the income tax return of its&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;member.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Subsequent Events&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.5pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company has evaluated subsequent events through April 7, 2026, which is the date the financial statements were available to be issued. No significant matters were identified for disclosure during this evaluation.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 40.8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; text-indent: -18pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;PREPAID OPERATING LEASE RIGHT-OF-USE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;ASSET&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/h2&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.3pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On July 3, 2012, CST prepaid $85,194,000 for the lease rights to 50% of the transfer capability of the Border-East Transmission line from SDG&amp;amp;E, which is a 30-mile portion of the 117-mile Sunrise Powerlink Transmission Project, which provides over 1,000 MW of transmission capacity connecting the San Diego metropolitan area with renewable resources in California's Imperial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Valley.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Amortization for both of the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 amounted to approximately&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;$2,840,000 and is included in rent expense on the statements of income and member's deficit. Amortization of the prepaid lease for the next five years is expected to be approximately $2,840,000 per year. Prepaid operating lease ROU asset at December 31, 2025 and 2024 consists of the following:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.2pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 426pt; margin-left: 81.85pt; border-collapse: collapse"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 18.7pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 256.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 89.55pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 39pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.2pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.8pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 32.25pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.2pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 18.9pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 256.65pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6.05pt; margin-left: 2.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Prepaid operating lease ROU asset, current portion&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 89.55pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6.05pt; margin-right: 5.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.85pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 21.7pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"