					&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 5.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 79.8pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 2.3pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 11.4pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.05pt; margin-right: 11.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-left: 40.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;REGULATORY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;ASSET&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 11.45pt 0 51.55pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On February 21, 2012, the FERC conditionally accepted in Docket No. ER 12-686-000 the CST tariff and revenue requirement which included the capitalization of development costs related to CST. The FERC approval was subject to a compliance filing to provide the actual cost data. The FERC Order allows amortization of development costs into rates over the thirty year life of the lease. On October 26, 2012, the FERC accepted in Docket No. ER 12-686-001 the CST compliance filing, which included capitalization of $6,956,000 of development costs related to CST. The compliance filing was accepted effective July 3, 2012, the date the project became operational.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.15pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Amortization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;during&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;both&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.55pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.6pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.45pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;amounted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.5pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;approximately&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;$232,000.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.85pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Amortization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.9pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.8pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.7pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.8pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.7pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;five&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.8pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;expected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.75pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;approximately&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;$232,000 per year. Regulatory assets at December 31, 2025 and 2024 consist of the following:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 41.85pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 58.75pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-right: 18.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Regulatory asset,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;portion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span