&lt;/div&gt; 		&lt;br style="clear: both" /&gt; 		&lt;div class="Section_2"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Long-term debt consisted of the following at December 31:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On July 3, 2012, CST issued $98,079,000 of Senior Secured Notes with a 4.85% interest rate. The notes call for semi-annual payments of approximately $3,120,000, including interest until July 2042. The notes are secured by a first priority security interest in all of CST's assets and are not cross-collateralized or guaranteed by any affiliate of the Company (effective&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;br style="clear: both" /&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 31.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 58.8pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt; 		&lt;br style="page-break-before: always; clear: both" /&gt; 		&lt;div class="Section_3"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.4pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;5.07%).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 228.82pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 16.2pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;71,673,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 6.6pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 16.2pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;74,338,000&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0.45pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;Unamortized debt issuance costs on the above senior secured&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 51.55pt; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 12.6pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;notes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 276.02pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 15.45pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;(1,368,038&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 8.36pt; font-size: 12pt; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 15.45pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Console&amp;quot;; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-block"&gt